            <ArticleTitle>Widespread cutaneous vasculitis associated with diltiazem.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>467-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of widespread cutaneous vasculitis are described in association with diltiazem, a recently introduced calcium antagonist. In both cases, spontaneous resolution occurred over several weeks following withdrawal of the drug.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
